    "description": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\">\n <p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual\">Star Wars Saga Edition Jedi Academy Training Manual</a></i> </p>\n <p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Regimens\" title=\"Force Regimens\">Force Regimens</a></i> </p>\n <p>This Training Regimen is used to awaken another character to the larger world of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a>. You and the beneficiary of this Force Regimen practice meditation, quieting your minds and listening to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a>. </p>\n <p><b>Time:</b> 1 Hour </p>\n <p><b>Targets:</b> One willing ally who does not possess the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> Feat. </p>\n <p><b>Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> check.</b> The result of the check determines the benefits of the regimen: </p> \n <table class=\"wikitable\"> \n  <tbody>\n   <tr> \n    <th>DC </th> \n    <th> </th> \n    <th>EFFECT </th>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>13-17 </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You gain the benefit of the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gauge_Force_Potential\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gauge Force Potential\">Gauge Force Potential</a></b> Talent (If you do not already have it). </td>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>18-22 </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You gain the benefit of the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gauge_Force_Potential\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gauge Force Potential\">Gauge Force Potential</a></b> Talent (If you do not already have it). Additionally, you awaken the first glimmers of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> in the target. For the next 24 hours, the target can make Untrained <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks as though he or she possesses the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> Feat. </td>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>23-27 </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You gain the benefit of the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gauge_Force_Potential\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gauge Force Potential\">Gauge Force Potential</a></b> Talent (If you do not already have it). Additionally, you awaken the first glimmers of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> in the target. For the next 24 hours, the target can make Untrained <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks, with a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus, as though he or she possesses the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> Feat. </td>\n   </tr> \n   <tr> \n    <td>28+ </td> \n    <td> </td> \n    <td>You gain the benefit of the <b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gauge_Force_Potential\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gauge Force Potential\">Gauge Force Potential</a></b> Talent (If you do not already have it). Additionally, you awaken the first glimmers of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> in the target. For the next 24 hours, the target can make Untrained <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks, with a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus, as though he or she possesses the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Sensitivity\" title=\"Force Sensitivity\">Force Sensitivity</a> Feat. </td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table> <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20220326231711\nCache expiry: 1209600\nDynamic content: false\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--> <!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n--> <!-- Saved in parser cache with key prod:swse:pcache:idhash:6870-0!canonical!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20220326231711 and revision id 16515\n --> \n</div>",
